00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:04.020
Once their interests don't align 
with yours, that opinion changes!

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:20.150
The majority of what's going 
on in the world isn't peaceful!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:27.360
There's no such thing as a perfect 50/50 split!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:31.760
Even when you share the same ideals,

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:33.840
making certain distinctions 
can still be hard, true.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.000
So what happens?

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.710
The fighting doesn't stop!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:42.160
But even then, the POW human 
and POW kappa don't give up!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.310
They try again!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.610
Even if what they think is right doesn't work,

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:51.070
they keep thinking, and keep 
doing what they believe is right!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:54.070
Hey, neither of them will 
be able to back down, now!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.620
Are they both going to die?

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.210
The path they ultimately choose is...

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.390
You've got until morning.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.630
Roger, dodger, and wilco!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:19.140
<b>Film</b>

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.640
<b>Film</b>

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.140
<b>Film</b>

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.400
<b>Film</b>

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:31.900
<b>Film</b>

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.910
<b>Film</b>

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:57.180
I'm here to deliver that 
data you were asking for.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.180
<b>Shibahama Shopping District's
Local Celebration Anime!
On Sale at Comet A!</b>

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:12.410
I've arranged for the DVDs.

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:16.510
You need to be done in the next
 43 minutes and 30 seconds.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:20.230
Roger that!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:19.410
<b>Film</b>

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:30.690
So how much are you spending today?

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:31.710
Gonna hit a convenience store first.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.710
You think the Katou sisters 
will be there this year?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:35.090
Uh, what sisters are those?

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:38.220
I heard there's a new anime 
from Studio Kobanzame.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:39.330
For real?

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:41.630
They updated their blog out 
of nowhere this morning.

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.280
<i>Good morning.</i>

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:54.090
<i>As of this moment, Comet A is now open.</i>

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.690
I'll take one of those red ones.

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:06.750
No, the other red.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.900
Oh, we're out of 100 yen coins...

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:09.750
Oh, that'd be a huge help!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:13.840
<b>Blast Past Those Borders!
Monthly Borders</b>

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:13.840
Kinda feels... like we're 
kind of out of place, here.

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:16.780
How long did it take to make this?

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:17.970
Eight years.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:19.340
Eight...

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.320
There she is! Tsubame Mizusaki!

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:26.560
<b>Traveling to</b>

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:26.560
<b>Iceland</b>

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.340
So cute!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.570
Hey, this is it.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:23.570
Her face is so tiny!

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:24.580
Thank you very much!

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:25.540
This says it's set in Shibahama.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.850
That'll be 1,000 yen.

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:34.210
Yakisoba omelets.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.700
Thanks muchly.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:36.860
Here you are.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:37.770
There I am.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:50.250
<b>The cut scene that Tsubame Mizusaki
poured her heart and soul into!
Purchase a DVD and you'll be able
to see the finished version 
(with sound) online in the future!</b>

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.260
<b>Eizouken</b>

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.760
<b>Love</b>

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:11.270
<b>Large-Scale Farming Machinery
 Anime</b>

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:19.400
Thank you very much!

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:23.630
I wasn't mentally ready for this.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:29.150
I'm not sure where I am, or what I'm doing here.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.790
It doesn't feel real.

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:34.930
All these folks, who've lived 
lives totally different from mine,

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.800
who are neither friend or foe,

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:41.890
come here, hand cash over, 
and walk away with a box, but why?

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:46.570
So tired. Wanna go home.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:49.920
You're really cute!

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.390
Eizouken
<b>Anime</b>

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:51.390
Thank you so much!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:56.290
This is a thoroughfare! Please stay in motion!

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:58.650
I'm hungry for some sincere criticism.

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:01.930
I bet that's something that'll never go away.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.910
All right.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:06.490
Time for paper bags.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.740
<b>Pictures</b>

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.860
Is that Tsubame Mizusaki?

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:13.130
Seems pretty obvious who she is, bag or not.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:16.010
And that's fine. It's all stagecraft.

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:21.760
The idea of "The model who makes anime" 
helps strengthen Mizusaki's identity,

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:26.510
@kpst_066
I saw something, but I dunno if it's her or not. #TsubameMizusaki

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:23.490
but if we have people speculating on why

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.400
she would go as far as to hide her identity,

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.510
just because she's making anime...

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.600
It will amplify their interest in the project.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.990
I'd like a copy.

