00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:39.020
I'm a big fan!

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.230
Thanks!

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:40.690
It's 1,000 yen a piece.

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.310
I'll take one.

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:43.200
Thank you.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.300
Excuse me, can I get one?

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.300
Thanks for coming by!

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:51.200
That'll be 1,000 yen.

